      "customReadme": "# 🏛️ Nagar Sampark (नगर सम्पर्क)\n\n**Offline-First Public Government & Official Directory Application**\n\nNagar Sampark was built during my **Government On-the-Job Training (OJT)** internship. It provides citizens with instant, offline access to verified contact details of municipal employees, elected officials, and public service departments.\n\n---\n\n## 🌟 Key Highlights\n- 🇳🇵 **Bilingual Interface**: Designed for seamless accessibility in both **English & Nepali**.\n- ⚡ **Offline-First & Ultra Fast**: All contact data is embedded locally for instant search without active internet.\n- 🔍 **Smart Quick Search**: Easily locate municipal officers, phone numbers, email addresses, and office hours.\n- 🔒 **Privacy Focused**: No user data collection, tracking, or cloud logins required.\n\n---\n\n## 📂 Public Contact Data Repository\nDue to government security policies, the application codebase remains private; however, the **public directory dataset** used by the app is open-source and available here:\n👉 [Nagar Contact Data Repository](https://github.com/Aaryanbanskota/nagar-contact-data)\n"
    },
